0.007 - 2026-11-27
  - cpangit-add
     - New feature `--local` imports a dist to L/LO/LOCAL for customization
       and sets this local version as the provider for the contained modules.
  - cpangit-audit: New tool listing every dist of a branch for which a newer
    dist is available in its import sources, and which versions are affected
    by CVEs.
  - cpangit-diff: New tool for comprehensively diffing two versions of the
    same dist, primarily for showing what would change if it were upgraded.
  - When importing a dist into a branch, warn if it provides modules which
    were not indexed at the source.  This could be a sign that it is
    violating namespace permissions.
  - New module CPAN::InGit::Advisories looks up CVEs in the CPANSA feed, with
    the same semantics as the web interface.
  - ArchiveTree: New method `find_upgrades` compares the index with other
    trees, grouping modules by (dist here, dist there).
  - CPAN::InGit:
     - New method `load_advisories` and attributes `cve_feed_url`,
       `cve_feed_path`, `cve_feed_max_age`.
     - New attribute `dist_cache_repo` provides a Git::Repo for cached
       unpacking of dists without polluting the main repo.
     - Removed method `process_distfile` which has been superceeded by
       DistTree and its methods.
  - MutableTree:
     - New methods list_dir and diff
     - set_path accepts a hashref or Git tree to replace a whole directory
     - get_path can return directories
  - New class CPAN::InGit::DistTree gives access to the files, META, change
    log, and prereqs of a distribution, and can compare two distributions.
    Get one from new method ArchiveTree->get_dist.
  - ArchiveTree:
     - get_dist_meta falls back to the META inside of the distribution
     - get_dist: new method returns CPAN::InGit::DistTree instances
     - import_dist writes the .meta file from the distribution if the source
       tree lacks one
     - dist_storage: new method indicates whether a dist is stored as a single
       archive file or is already unpacked in the repo.
  - Server:
     - Browse the files of a distribution at authors/id/.../Dist-1.0.tar.gz/
     - New views of a distribution: ~changes, ~meta, and ~diff?to=OTHER_DIST
     - The "Src. Ver." column of the index links to a ~diff of the pinned
       distribution vs. the one in the import source.
     - The front-end can now collapse modules from the same dist and matching
       prefix, for readability.

0.006 - 2026-10-29
  - Server:
     - Fix ability to run Mojo server mounted at a deeper path than '/'
     - Fix ability to serve branch and tag names containing '/'
     - Add canonical ~branch/, ~tag/, and ~commit/ paths
     - Resolve friendly tree paths to these canonical paths before routing
       so that Mojo's URL caching doesn't hide changes in available git refs.

0.005 - 2026-10-29
  - Declare missing dependency on Log::Any::Adapter::MojoLog
  - Suppress ssl-related crash on FreeBSD from tests, since the bug
    needs fixed upstream in Git::Raw.

0.004 - 2026-10-28
  - Fix ability for commands to update the index of the working branch
  - Server:
     - Serve an index page for the whole repository, optionally listing
       available branches
     - Serve an index page for each archive tree, browsing or filtering
       the module list, and javascript feature to compare the list to the
       CVE database.

0.003 - 2026-01-14
  - cpangit-add can now process cpanfile or cpanfile.snapshot
  - New method ArchiveTree->import_cpanfile_snapshot
  - Support for backpan via MirrorTree->upstream_backup_url

0.002 - 2025-12-19
  - Sort 02packages.details.txt case-insensitive so that it works with
    binary search required by CPAN::02Packages::Search used by App::cpm
  - Server:
      - Refresh cache if a branch receives new commits
      - Limit cache to 20 trees (LRU) when Tree::RB::XS is available
      - Fix bugs in ability to generate .tar.gz files from dist dir

0.001 - 2025-12-16
  - Initial mostly-usable release
